{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49857","headline":"南乡子 一 · 冯延巳","name":"南乡子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细雨湿流光，芳草年年与恨长。\n烟锁凤楼无限事，茫茫，鸾镜鸳衾两断肠。\n魂梦任悠扬，睡起杨花满绣牀。\n薄幸不来门半掩，斜阳，负你残春泪几行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}